notes.content:
This update brings many requested quality of life improvements, bug fixes and new features.


- Shaders: A pixelated retro shader can now be activated through the pause menu;

- Settings: Settings can now be accessed from the pause menu;

- Running: Player running speed has been increased;

- Distances: Some islands had their size reduced to opmimize on foot traversing;

- B-29: B-29's spawn rates have been fixed;

- New items: New items have been added to the game;

- Harbour Smokes: Smoke signs have been added to harbours, making it easier for players to identify them;

- Tutorial Hints: Hints now display on the screen to guide players, but it is still up to them to figure most things out;

- Crashes: Fixed some bugs that caused the game to crash, even on higher end machines;

- New events: New random events have been added;


More will follow.
